  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I can understand the idea to make everything look like a mobile app when it come to the game itself but if an user need to have mobile interface to upload an avatar or a world, they probably won't even reach the sdk builder page to begin with. This is the kind of design philosophy that make people use VRCX instead of your website.",
